{"id":"bc88ca69b33d5036","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-natural-representation.md","title":"自然数的规范二进制与自定界编码","display":"df-binary-natural-representation — 自然数的规范二进制与自定界编码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-natural-representation","aliases":["73-df-binary-natural-representation"],"display":"df-binary-natural-representation — 自然数的规范二进制与自定界编码","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.2.2 and §11.5.3, print pp. 435–436, 516–517; PDF pp. 457–458, 538–539; local explicit size-controlled coding","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-natural-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-natural-representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-binary-natural-representation — 自然数的规范二进制与自定界编码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.2.2 and §11.5.3, print pp. 435–436, 516–517; PDF pp. 457–458, 538–539; local explicit size-controlled coding"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,u,v\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(w,u,v\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 仅在下式给出的规范词唯一性下使用；所有拼接都是有限词拼接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BVal}(w)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=0}^{|w|-1}w(i)2^{|w|-1-i},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{NatWords}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle1\\rangle v:v\\in\\mathbf2^*\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BVal}(w)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=0}^{|w|-1}w(i)2^{|w|-1-i},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{NatWords}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle1\\rangle v:v\\in\\mathbf2^*\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists!w\\in\\mathsf{NatWords}\\;\\operatorname{BVal}(w)=n,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Bin}(n)\\coloneqq\\iota w\\in\\mathsf{NatWords}\\;\\operatorname{BVal}(w)=n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists!w\\in\\mathsf{NatWords}\\;\\operatorname{BVal}(w)=n,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Bin}(n)\\coloneqq\\iota w\\in\\mathsf{NatWords}\\;\\operatorname{BVal}(w)=n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NumCode}(n)\\coloneqq\\langle1\\rangle^{|\\operatorname{Bin}(n)|}\\langle0\\rangle\\operatorname{Bin}(n),\\quad\n\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\langle1\\rangle^{|\\tau|}\\langle0\\rangle\n\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=0}^{|\\tau|-1}\\operatorname{NumCode}(\\tau(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NumCode}(n)\\coloneqq\\langle1\\rangle^{|\\operatorname{Bin}(n)|}\\langle0\\rangle\\operatorname{Bin}(n),\\quad\n\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\langle1\\rangle^{|\\tau|}\\langle0\\rangle\n\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=0}^{|\\tau|-1}\\operatorname{NumCode}(\\tau(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PairBits}(u,v)\\coloneqq\\langle1\\rangle^{|u|}\\langle0\\rangle uv.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PairBits}(u,v)\\coloneqq\\langle1\\rangle^{|u|}\\langle0\\rangle uv.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>除零表示为 0 外，规范词首位为 1；反复除以 2 的余数给出存在唯一性。NumCode 先给二进制长度，NatListCode 先给项目数，PairBits 先给首字段长度，故都可确定解析。这里不复用只保证“可计算”的任意元组编码，避免在多项式归约中隐藏过大代价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"w,u,v\\in\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BVal}(w)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=0}^{|w|-1}w(i)2^{|w|-1-i},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{NatWords}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle1\\rangle v:v\\in\\mathbf2^*\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists!w\\in\\mathsf{NatWords}\\;\\operatorname{BVal}(w)=n,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Bin}(n)\\coloneqq\\iota w\\in\\mathsf{NatWords}\\;\\operatorname{BVal}(w)=n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NumCode}(n)\\coloneqq\\langle1\\rangle^{|\\operatorname{Bin}(n)|}\\langle0\\rangle\\operatorname{Bin}(n),\\quad\n\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\langle1\\rangle^{|\\tau|}\\langle0\\rangle\n\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=0}^{|\\tau|-1}\\operatorname{NumCode}(\\tau(i)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PairBits}(u,v)\\coloneqq\\langle1\\rangle^{|u|}\\langle0\\rangle uv.","display":true}],"bytes":2090,"backlinks":[{"id":"a3d01ee2a38f6e35","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NCFG}$ 在下式定义；在 $Y_P$ 与 $\\operatorname{CFGCode}$ 的子句中，固定 $G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}$，各分量均为该文法的投影。$\\operatorname{NumCode}$ 与 $\\operatorname{NatListCode}$ 采用 [[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]。"},{"id":"38a6929b52694b0f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$G,H\\in\\mathsf{NCFG}$，$\\Sigma_G=\\pi_2(G)$；配对编码为 [[73-df-binary-natural-representation]] 的 $\\operatorname{PairBits}$。本条各集合仅含合法代码；两文法问题还要求终结字母表相同。"},{"id":"4f6d4d247465f3c9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4723b54e4035a6fb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"498d8afd65d4a6ee","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；整除 $d\\mid n$ 具有通常整数算术含义。$\\mathsf{NatWords},\\operatorname{Bin}$ 见 [[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]。"},{"id":"aa25b0fd9e2cf41e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-243","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-natural-representation|自然数的规范二进制与自定界编码]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"11ad5a1f324e7f83","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}$，$a,e\\in\\mathbb N$；输入输出编码取 [[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]。$\\mathsf{FP}$ 是 [[73-df-polynomial-string-functions]] 定义的总多项式时间二进制词函数类，$f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*$，$w\\in\\mathbf2^*$。下式 $f$ 的合法输入为三项自然数列表编码，其他词返回 $\\operatorname{Bin}(0)$。"},{"id":"1774225169821832","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f2f999bbeb3c1da6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$；$\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}$ 见 [[73-df-binary-pcp-coding]]。在前两个子句中，$k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k$，$\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{<\\omega}$，$j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\iota|\\}$；序列截取由下式定义。最后的集合构造独立绑定 $k,I,\\iota$；$\\operatorname{PairBits}$ 与 $\\operatorname{NatListCode}$ 采用 [[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]。"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}